# ==============================================================================
# BriskOS Office & Productivity Suite
# Minimal footprint productivity applications and font compatibility
# ==============================================================================

# Primary Office Suite (ONLYOFFICE Desktop Editors / LibreOffice Minimal Fallback)
# Note: For production builds with ONLYOFFICE, configure upstream repository:
# deb [signed-by=/usr/share/keyrings/onlyoffice.gpg] https://download.onlyoffice.com/repo/debian squeeze main
# and uncomment 'onlyoffice-desktopeditors'.
# Standard Debian 13 (Trixie) repository fallback:
# onlyoffice-desktopeditors
libreoffice-writer
libreoffice-calc

# Microsoft-Compatible Metric Substitution Fonts (offline-safe)
fonts-crosextra-carlito
fonts-crosextra-caladea

# Note: ttf-mscorefonts-installer is preseeded and installed best-effort in
# config/hooks/live/00-setup-multiarch-and-extras.hook.chroot so EULA prompts
# or SourceForge network outages never block automated ISO builds.

# Document & Image Viewers
evince
viewnior
